WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.704
Abhyankar-Sathaye fails in four variables.

2
00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:05.521
Its zero set is affine three-space, yet

3
00:00:05.521 --> 00:00:07.424
the polynomial is not a coordinate.

4
00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:12.548
At one point, all four slopes vanish, which no coordinate allows.

5
00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:17.490
Claimed: a counterexample in every dimension from four.

6
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:19.368
Main theorem Lean-checked.
